      "value": "I'd go with a broader \"Photosensitive\" warning than explicitly \"Epileptic\", just because it's one of those things where some people will read the latter and not think it applies to them and then, whoops, migraine. \n\nDefinitely apply this to Avatar tags as well, so you can just disable anything with that tag from a setting.",
